  "details": "I know this has been requested already. But if we give it a shot to start by allowing to spawn objects locally only, then we can start safe and allow users to interact better with worlds and for content creation. Example, I want to record my avatar smoking, but the best smoking world has ugly landscape. The world with the best pickable guitar, has bad lighting and for a microphone I need to go to another world or as one of my friends to become a guitar avatar and roleplay accordingly. This will also reduce the need of uploading avatars to perform as objects. If you decide to spawn and show objects globally, people should have the option to disable viewing that to prevent abuse of the feature and lagging other users.\nThanks, cheers!",
